0 30 646 [
[(The [line~] object generates linear ramps whose levels and timing are determined by)]
[(messages you send it. Note that the right inlet value \050for ramp time in milliseconds\051)]
[(is cleared when the object receives a value in the left inlet \050unlike other objects)]
[(in Pd\051. Thus, if you don't reset a time in the right inlet before sending [line~] a)]
[(float, it jumps immediately to the target value. You can also use a list of two)]
[(floats to distribute the values over the inlets \050as usual in Pd\051, which keeps)]
[(resetting the time ramp.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
